WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.137
♪♪

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.471
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:06.806
According
to The Washington Post,

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:09.442
President Biden exercises
most mornings

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:12.111
by lifting weights
before he begins work.

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.513
That makes sense
because he is clearly

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:16.115
not using the StairMaster.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:18.517
[ Laughter ]
I'm sorry, but the clip is fun.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:20.119
He's fine.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:21.454
[ Laughter ]
According to
The Washington Post,

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:24.324
President Biden occasionally
goes to the South Lawn

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.392
or Rose Garden during the day
to get fresh air

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.328
with his dogs, Champ and Major,

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:32.565
while the rest of the staff
goes literally anywhere else.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.301
Somebody commented me
that it's time

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:38.638
to stop making fun
of Major biting people.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.074
I feel like a year.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.142
He has to go a year
without biting anyone.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.777
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:47.279
President Biden said on Friday
that he would not allow

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:48.581
the Justice Department

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.017
to seize the phone records
of journalists.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:53.519
Well, that explains
Matt Gaetz's new hat.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:56.922
[ Laughter ]
President Biden has reportedly
continued a tradition,

00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:58.858
started
by former President Obama,

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.994
of reading ten letters
each night

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.963
that are sent to the White House
by individual Americans.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.598
Though, in the Obama days,

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.534
they were mostly from Joe.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.503
Former Vice President Mike Pence

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.204
and former
Second Lady Karen Pence

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:15.441
have reportedly purchased a new
home outside of Indianapolis.

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:17.243
And, of course,
it was outside the city

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.613
because you know this guy
doesn't go downtown.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.816
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.450
Baze!

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.786
Alex Baze,
as I live and breathe!

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.454
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:30.923
A New York librarian
was arrested last Friday

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:32.558
for allegedly robbing a bank.

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.827
Well, trying to, at least.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:36.896
[ Whispering ]
Okay, everyone hit the floor.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.531
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.500
Because they'd whisper
outside the library.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.168
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.369
That's the thing
about librarians.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.770
People think it's
about the library.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:48.407
It's fundamentally inside them.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:50.643
It was announced last week
that Pope Francis

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.645
will get a new
electric Popemobile.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:55.681
Of course, before he can plug
the charger into the outlet,

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:56.916
they have to get married.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.118
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:01.887
According to a new study,
dogs can effectively detect

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:04.424
the coronavirus
with 97% accuracy,

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.792
which is great news because

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:08.828
that's the only provider
in your network.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.530
Scientists reported that the
largest iceberg in the world

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.666
broke off from Antarctica
last week

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.969
and it's roughly 70 times
larger than Manhattan.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.606
Yeah, but I bet they don't have
any good restaurants.

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:23.442
And, finally, yesterday was
Lucky Penny Day.

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:26.279
Right, because who's luckier
than Abraham Lincoln?

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.747
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.747 --> 00:02:31.884
Look, I don't have to read
the Mike Scollins jokes.

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:33.986
I get that.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:37.490
But, if I didn't,
you wouldn't know

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.726
what I'm putting up with,
day in and day out.

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.627
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:43.896
"If you see something,
say something."

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:45.264
♪♪

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:47.800
The National Guard yesterday
began withdrawing troops

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.103
from the U.S. Capitol following
a five-month deployment

00:02:51.103 --> 00:02:52.639
after the January insurrection.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:55.541
Which is strange,
considering they didn't even get

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:58.043
all the insurrectionists
out, yet.

00:02:58.043 --> 00:02:59.778
The White House announced
today that the U.S. has

00:02:59.778 --> 00:03:03.483
officially vaccinated 50%
of its adult population

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.985
and they expect that,
by the end of September,

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:09.322
they will have vaccinated
the other 7% or 8%.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:11.023
[ Laughter ]
That's right, the White House

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:13.893
announced today that the U.S.
has officially vaccinated

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.795
50% of its adult population,

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.498
as well as one 11-year-old
with a mustache.

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Laughter ]
"Uh, could I get a Moderna

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.335
and a case of

00:03:23.335 --> 00:03:25.004
Mike's Hard Lemonade?

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:26.305
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:28.174
Whose Schwinn is that outside?

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.208
So lame!"

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:30.310
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.945
President Biden
is expected to meet

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.912
with Russian President
Vladimir Putin

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:35.381
next month in Switzerland

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.317
for their first
face-to-face summit

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.452
or, you know, face-to-chest.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:41.653
I just hope it does not come
down to a staring contest

00:03:41.653 --> 00:03:45.224
because both of those guys
have had a lot of Botox.

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:46.893
Could be a long one.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.461
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:50.562
that Secretary of State
Tony Blinken

00:03:50.562 --> 00:03:52.465
will travel this week to Israel

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:55.468
to discuss the cease-fire
between Israel and Hamas.

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:58.304
Okay, can we send someone
a little more intimidating?

00:03:58.304 --> 00:03:59.872
Tony Blinken looks like a guy

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:02.141
who thinks your mom's
a real special lady,

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:04.143
but isn't trying
to replace your dad.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:05.777
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.777 --> 00:04:09.047
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday signed a law

00:04:09.047 --> 00:04:11.483
regulating social media
companies' moderation

00:04:11.483 --> 00:04:12.952
of user speech.
Said Twitter,

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:15.988
"Sir, that's just --
it's just spell-check."

00:04:15.988 --> 00:04:18.124
Vice President Kamala Harris
said yesterday

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:22.027
that broadband Internet is
"critical to infrastructure"

00:04:22.027 --> 00:04:23.362
and then, Spectrum added

00:04:23.362 --> 00:04:26.032
a 30-cent critical
to infrastructure fee.

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:28.033
[ Laughter ]
Google announced last week

00:04:28.033 --> 00:04:30.536
it will open its first-ever
physical retail store

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.404
this summer in New York
and get this --

00:04:32.404 --> 00:04:34.240
Tinder already did.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.374
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.374 --> 00:04:36.709
That's right,
Google announced last week

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:39.044
it will open its first-ever
physical retail store

00:04:39.044 --> 00:04:41.780
this summer in New York,
although, it will be weird

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.916
to ask a salesperson a question

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.652
and get 1.3 million answers.

00:04:46.652 --> 00:04:48.621
[ Laughter ]
A Florida woman who was wearing

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:51.223
nearly no clothing
was arrested over the weekend

00:04:51.223 --> 00:04:52.892
after she allegedly stole a car

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.927
and led authorities
on a high-speed chase.

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.996
And to give you an idea
what Florida's like,

00:04:56.996 --> 00:05:00.466
the police in Florida refer
to that as a code 1.

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:03.002
A bank robbery is a code 2.

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:04.403
According to new research,

00:05:04.403 --> 00:05:08.941
a day on Venus lasts
nearly 6,000 hours.

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.509
"So, same as Earth?"

00:05:10.509 --> 00:05:12.611
asked Amazon workers.

00:05:12.611 --> 00:05:15.114
And, finally, producers have
announced that a documentary

00:05:15.114 --> 00:05:17.550
about lifestyle expert
Martha Stewart

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.817
will stream on Netflix.

00:05:18.817 --> 00:05:21.453
And, if you don't have
a Netflix account,

00:05:21.453 --> 00:05:23.389
she'll show you how to make one

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:25.458
out of driftwood and corn husks.

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:26.859
♪♪

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:29.195
The Manhattan district attorney
has reportedly convened

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.564
a grand jury
that is expected to decide

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:33.532
whether to indict
former President Trump.

00:05:33.532 --> 00:05:35.935
God, imagine that arrest.

00:05:35.935 --> 00:05:37.570
"You have
the right to an attorney.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.339
But, as a friend,
I wouldn't recommend it."

00:05:40.339 --> 00:05:43.209
Former President Trump said
on his website today

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:44.876
that his administration
is the reason

00:05:44.876 --> 00:05:48.180
for low coronavirus cases
and successful vaccine rollout

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.015
in the U.S.,
which is sort of like

00:05:50.015 --> 00:05:51.684
the captain of the Hindenburg
saying,

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:54.420
"Don't forget who got us
off the ground."

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.755
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:05:56.755 --> 00:05:58.591
is facing criticism
after tweeting

00:05:58.591 --> 00:06:00.759
that coronavirus
vaccine passports

00:06:00.759 --> 00:06:02.795
and mask mandates
are just like

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:05.798
Nazis forcing Jewish people
to wear a gold star.

00:06:05.798 --> 00:06:10.335
It's the first time she's wanted
people to be undocumented.

00:06:10.335 --> 00:06:13.505
A junior high principal
in Arkansas apologized recently

00:06:13.505 --> 00:06:16.175
after the school's yearbook
featured a photo

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:18.577
of former President Donald Trump
with the caption,

00:06:18.577 --> 00:06:20.780
"President Trump
was not impeached."

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:25.852
He also apologized for the claim
that Trump was...

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:29.388
According to a new study,
researchers believe

00:06:29.388 --> 00:06:32.191
that the maximum age
a human could physically reach

00:06:32.191 --> 00:06:34.026
is 150 years old.

00:06:34.026 --> 00:06:35.127
"Challenge accepted,"

00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:37.597
said the U.S. Senate.

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:40.266
Former baseball player
Alex Rodriguez

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:43.535
recently launched a line
of concealer for men,

00:06:43.535 --> 00:06:47.306
and then men tried
to put it on wedding rings.

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:48.941
[ Laughter ]

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:52.244
I tried -- I tried to do the --
deliver it

00:06:52.244 --> 00:06:54.380
the way I feel Jenny
would have wanted me to.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.814
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.814 --> 00:06:56.983
"And then men..."

00:06:56.983 --> 00:07:00.520
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.956
According to a new study,
relocating wolves

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:07.226
to areas with frequent
car accidents caused by deer

00:07:07.226 --> 00:07:09.528
can reduce collisions by 24%,

00:07:09.528 --> 00:07:11.130
which almost makes up

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:14.634
for the 3,000% increase
in wolf attacks.

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:17.102
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.102 --> 00:07:20.072
According to a recent survey,
the average American believes

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:23.142
they can survive for 16 days
in the wilderness,

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:26.479
adding, "Wait,
what's the Wi-Fi password?"

00:07:26.479 --> 00:07:28.347
Today is World Redhead Day,

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:30.950
but then the sun came out
and they had to cancel.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:35.387
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:37.456
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:07:37.456 --> 00:07:40.493
poison control centers
in the U.S. experienced

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:43.195
a significant increase
in marijuana-related calls

00:07:43.195 --> 00:07:45.631
between 2017 and 2019,

00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:47.633
and they always started
the same way.

00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:49.601
Hello?
What's the emergency?

00:07:49.601 --> 00:07:51.937
"Hello? Who is this?"

00:07:51.937 --> 00:07:53.806
Man, you called me.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:54.940
♪♪

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:58.844
President Biden yesterday
called on China

00:07:58.844 --> 00:08:02.848
to participate in a, "full,
transparent, evidence-based,

00:08:02.848 --> 00:08:06.752
internal investigation to find
the origins of COVID-19."

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.821
Said China,
"Honestly, can this wait?

00:08:08.821 --> 00:08:10.823
We are just slammed
with COVID-21.

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:13.592
Or, I mean, sure, no problem."

00:08:13.592 --> 00:08:16.629
That's right, President Biden
called on China to participate

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:19.332
in an investigation to find
the origins of COVID-19,

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:22.268
and I just got to say,
if it's not bats,

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:25.237
we owe them a major apology.

00:08:25.237 --> 00:08:27.506
It's going to be like one of
those double jeopardy scenarios

00:08:27.506 --> 00:08:29.742
where they've been wrongfully
blamed for a crime,

00:08:29.742 --> 00:08:33.212
so now they really do get
to start a pandemic.

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:35.214
According to a new report,
former President Trump

00:08:35.214 --> 00:08:38.417
tried to intervene in 2008
to stop the investigation

00:08:38.417 --> 00:08:41.754
of the New England Patriots'
so-called "Spygate" scandal.

00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:44.223
Wait, he was involved
in that scandal, too?

00:08:44.223 --> 00:08:46.759
He's like the Forrest Gump
of scandals.

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:50.963
Next, we're going to find out he
was one of the 1919 Black Sox.

00:08:50.963 --> 00:08:52.364
British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:08:52.364 --> 00:08:55.400
reportedly considered getting
the coronavirus injected

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.036
in his body
on live TV last summer

00:08:58.036 --> 00:09:00.106
because he thought the virus
wasn't a threat.

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:03.008
Who are you, Prime Minister
Johnny Knoxville?

00:09:03.008 --> 00:09:04.877
Boris Johnson's
the only UK leader

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:06.612
to come with his own
theme music.

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:09.415
[ "Jackass" theme song playing ]

00:09:09.415 --> 00:09:10.716
[ Laughter ]

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.185
The Recording Academy yesterday
announced changes

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:15.288
to the Grammy Awards'
nomination process.

00:09:15.288 --> 00:09:17.589
That's right --
you can now be nominated

00:09:17.589 --> 00:09:18.824
if you're Taylor Swift

00:09:18.824 --> 00:09:20.693
or Beyoncé.

00:09:20.693 --> 00:09:23.129
Today was Republican Congressman
Marjorie Taylor Greene's

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:26.498
47th birthday, which is also
the only accurate information

00:09:26.498 --> 00:09:28.233
on her Facebook page.

00:09:28.233 --> 00:09:30.135
That's right, today was
Republican Congresswoman

00:09:30.135 --> 00:09:31.870
Marjorie Taylor Greene's
47th birthday.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.473
And if you're wondering
what to get her, how about help?

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:38.077 line:0%
♪♪

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:39.812 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

